<</E(A second forward pass with the updated weights confirms that learning has occurred: the hidden outputs become h1 = 0.6342 and h2 = 0.6662, the prediction rises from 0.7272 to 0.7376, and the loss falls from 0.0372 to 0.0344 \(Table 4.2\). One step gives a small improvement, as expected with a modest learning rate, and repeating the cycle of forward pass, loss, backward pass, and update over many iterations and many examples steadily drives the loss toward its minimum.)/K[ 12]/P 90 0 R /Pg 20 0 R /S/P/Type/StructElem>>
endobj
