400 0 obj
<</E(The task adopted was a two-hundred-and-fifty-word script in which a university introduces a new artificial intelligence laboratory to prospective students, prepared as a web article, a spoken narration, and a short video presented by a digital avatar. The language model received a structured prompt stating role, audience, purpose, length, tone, and constraints, for example: act as an admissions officer, address first-year applicants, use a friendly but professional voice, avoid jargon, and end with a call to action. Variants were produced by changing one element at a time, such as tone or audience, so that the effect of each change could be observed, and every draft was saved with the prompt that created it.)/K[ 19]/P 92 0 R /Pg 22 0 R /S/H4/T(The task adopted was a two-hundred-and-fifty-word script in which a university introduces a new artificial intelligence laboratory to prospective students, prepared as a web article, a spoken narration, and a short video presented by a digital avatar. The language model received a structured prompt stating role, audience, purpose, length, tone, and constraints, for example: act as an admissions officer, address first-year applicants, use a friendly but professional voice, avoid jargon, and end with a call to action. Variants were produced by changing one element at a time, such as tone or audience, so that the effect of each change could be observed, and every draft was saved with the prompt that created it.)/Type/StructElem>>
endobj
401 0 obj
<</E(Natural language processing, or NLP,is the branch of artificial intelligence that enables computers to read, interpret, and generate human language. Modern generative tools are built on transformer-based large language models, trained on vast text collections to predict the next word, which lets them draft essays, emails, and scripts on request. Because such tools produce fluent text instantly, the real challenge is no longer producing content but judging whether it is good enough to use. This challenge was designed around that skill: the group generates content with an NLP tool and then evaluates it on clarity, tone, and, for multimedia formats, the body-language cues that accompany the words.)/K[ 20]/P 92 0 R /Pg 22 0 R /S/H4/T(Natural language processing, or NLP,is the branch of artificial intelligence that enables computers to read, interpret, and generate human language. Modern generative tools are built on transformer-based large language models, trained on vast text collections to predict the next word, which lets them draft essays, emails, and scripts on request. Because such tools produce fluent text instantly, the real challenge is no longer producing content but judging whether it is good enough to use. This challenge was designed around that skill: the group generates content with an NLP tool and then evaluates it on clarity, tone, and, for multimedia formats, the body-language cues that accompany the words.)/Type/StructElem>>
endobj
402 0 obj
<</E(The objectives were to practise writing effective prompts, to build a transparent rubric that several reviewers can apply consistently, and to understand why the quality of a text and of its delivery must be assessed separately when the same message becomes a video or an avatar speech.)/K[ 21]/P 92 0 R /Pg 22 0 R /S/H4/T(The objectives were to practise writing effective prompts, to build a transparent rubric that several reviewers can apply consistently, and to understand why the quality of a text and of its delivery must be assessed separately when the same message becomes a video or an avatar speech.)/Type/StructElem>>
endobj
