467 0 obj
<</E(The four modules of this group task follow one idea from the data upward. Module 2 showed how a big data system such as Google Maps moves data through sources, ingestion and storage, processing and output, and how its outputs return as new inputs. Module 3 turned the processing step into a disciplined machine learning workflow in which every decision diamond can send the team back to an earlier stage. Module 4 opened the neural network that sits inside many such models and verified by hand that a single backpropagation step lowers the loss from 0.0372 to 0.0344. Module 5 addressed the newest layer, generative AI, and argued that fluent output must still be judged for clarity, tone, delivery and ethics.)/K[ 17]/P 94 0 R /Pg 24 0 R /S/P/Type/StructElem>>
endobj
468 0 obj
<</E<>/K[ 18]/P 94 0 R /Pg 24 0 R /S/P/Type/StructElem>>
endobj
