<</Dest[ 14 0 R /Fit]/Parent 1223 0 R /Prev 1248 0 R /Title(Figure 2.1: End-to-end data-flow map of the case study, from data sources to user-facing output, with the feedback loop that returns every output to the system as new input.)>>
endobj
