1241 0 obj
<</Dest[ 22 0 R /Fit]/Next 1242 0 R /Parent 1227 0 R /Title(Natural language processing, or NLP,is the branch of artificial intelligence that enables computers to read, interpret, and generate human language. Modern generative tools are built on transformer-based large language models, trained on vast text collections to predict the next word, which lets them draft essays, emails, and scripts on request. Because such tools produce fluent text instantly, the real challenge is no longer producing content but judging whether it is good enough to use. This challenge was designed around that skill: the group generates content with an NLP tool and then evaluates it on clarity, tone, and, for multimedia formats, the body-language cues that accompany the words.)>>
endobj
1242 0 obj
<</Dest[ 22 0 R /Fit]/Parent 1227 0 R /Prev 1241 0 R /Title(The objectives were to practise writing effective prompts, to build a transparent rubric that several reviewers can apply consistently, and to understand why the quality of a text and of its delivery must be assessed separately when the same message becomes a video or an avatar speech.)>>
endobj
1243 0 obj
<</Count -4/Dest[ 22 0 R /Fit]/First 1255 0 R /Last 1256 0 R /Next 1228 0 R /Parent 1135 0 R /Prev 1227 0 R /Title(5.2 Content Generation Using an NLP Tool)>>
endobj
