<</Dest[ 25 0 R /Fit]/Next 1257 0 R /Parent 30 0 R /Prev 1229 0 R /Title(8. I. Goodfellow, Y. Bengio, and A. Courville, Deep Learning. MIT Press, 2016. Available: https://www.deeplearningbook.org/)>>
endobj
1245 0 obj
<</Dest[ 25 0 R /Fit]/Next 1230 0 R /Parent 30 0 R /Prev 1258 0 R /Title<31332E204F70656E41492C208D4172746966696369616C20496E74656C6C6967656E636520616E642047656E65726174697665204149205265736F75726365732E8E20417661696C61626C653A2068747470733A2F2F6F70656E61692E636F6D2F>>>
