1255 0 obj
<</Dest[ 22 0 R /Fit]/Next 1267 0 R /Parent 1243 0 R /Title(The task adopted was a two-hundred-and-fifty-word script in which a university introduces a new artificial intelligence laboratory to prospective students, prepared as a web article, a spoken narration, and a short video presented by a digital avatar. The language model received a structured prompt stating role, audience, purpose, length, tone, and constraints, for example: act as an admissions officer, address first-year applicants, use a friendly but professional voice, avoid jargon, and end with a call to action. Variants were produced by changing one element at a time, such as tone or audience, so that the effect of each change could be observed, and every draft was saved with the prompt that created it.)>>
endobj
